    intro="Missouri ranked just behind Texas in hail claim payouts in 2025, and its two major metros have very different housing: Kansas City's post-war suburbs and Johnson County growth on one side, St. Louis's brick city and St. Charles County expansion on the other. Spring hail and wind, humid summers and freeze-thaw winters keep roofing and HVAC steady, while basements and old foundations make waterproofing and structural work common financed projects.",
